    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67541" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήτε</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>and not</i>, mostly doubled, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήτε .
				. μήτε</span> . . <i>neither . . nor</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήτε . . , μήτ᾽
			οὖν</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				358
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				472
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδέ τῳ ἐκφάσθαι, μήτ᾽ ἀνδρῶν μήτε
					γυναικῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					13.308
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήτε . . , μηδέ</span>, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδέ; μήτε . . , τε</span>
			 . . <i>both not . . , and</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.230
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.63
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				454
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				12.72
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήτε . . , δέ</span> . .
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				421
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				627e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή . . , μήτε</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				496
			</span></i> codd., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				978
			</span></i> codd. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήτε</span> is perh. sts. omitted in the
			former of two clauses, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκόντα μήτ᾽ ἄκοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					771
				</span></i>
			 (v. l.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ant.</u>
				267
			</span></i>.</div>
